                        "review": "Motorcycle racing/collecting game.  Race Ducati-brand motorcycles.  Collect Ducati-brand motorcycles.  Go fast and stuff.\n\nNot a lot to say about the game.  It's racing motorcycles and building a collection, all showcasing the Ducati brand.  I have to quote Abraham Lincoln here: \"If you like this sort of thing, this is the sort of thing you'll like.\"  Racing games aren't typically my sort of thing, but I'm not going to fault anyone who does like them.\n\nNothing glaringly wrong with the game that I could see.  I wasn't very good at it, but that's not the game's fault.  I would have gotten it in a Humble Bundle for at most US$2.00.  At the current Steam price of US$10, if you like this sort of thing, this is probably the sort of price you'll like.  Giving it a positive review on the grounds of being inexpensive and free of major flaws.",
